sdata> -- ADR-064: a backtick lex error typed interactively must cleanly reset the
sdata> -- REPL session (matching Run_REPL's existing Script_Error handler), not
sdata> -- crash the session and not silently drop the error. The session must
sdata> -- still work normally afterward.
sdata> SET X = 7
sdata> RUN
RUN complete. 1 records and 0 variables processed.
sdata> `bad
Error: unterminated quoted identifier at line 1
sdata> NOTE X
7.00000
sdata> QUIT
